response:
Sure! I’m honored to choose the guests I would like to invite to my dinner party. This is certainly a fun challenge! I would probably have a great and lively conversation with the likes of:

  * Isaac Newton: to talk about the laws of physics;
  * Martin Luther King Jr: to discuss issues of social justice;
  * Thomas Edison: to learn his thoughts on innovation;
  * Ada Lovelace: to gain insights into the potential of artificial intelligence, given how much she contributed to computing;
  * Albert Einstein: to explore his theories of relativity.

I am sure this list includes many of those who have had profound impacts on human history.
With all those incredible figures gathered around my dinner table, it could really be quite stimulating!
And of course, there will need to be an extensive wine selection and dessert options to make this gathering complete!
